WEBVTT

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:05.070
During the battle with the Ayakashi
organization, the Kokuboro,

00:00:05.070 --> 00:00:07.530
Gen Shishio lost his life.

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.610
Yoshimori and the others understood
the importance of what they had lost

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.010
and were overcome with sadness.

00:00:15.840 --> 00:00:21.120
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.980
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:28.190
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:28.190 --> 00:00:30.090
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:30.590 --> 00:00:33.530
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:37.930
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:41.470
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:44.810
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:50.470
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:54.980
Sha la la la la...

00:00:56.320 --> 00:01:01.390
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:01.390 --> 00:01:03.360
(Secret romance)

00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:08.560
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:10.330
(A strange distance)

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:17.170
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:18.240
Yeah

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:21.710
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:21.710 --> 00:01:25.310
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:25.310 --> 00:01:30.650
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:01:47.100 --> 00:01:50.400
Hey, Sumimura.
It's rare to see you awake.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:53.200
Did something happen?

00:01:56.310 --> 00:02:01.340
By the way, I hear Gen Shishio
in Class 1 transferred out.

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:04.310
Must've been a family thing.

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:05.610
Do you know anything about it?

00:02:08.260 --> 00:02:10.120
Hey... Sumimura?

00:02:57.140 --> 00:02:58.370
Surely you jest.

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.340
As expected from the Number Two.

00:03:02.540 --> 00:03:06.410
Or, I suppose you're now
the leader of Task Force One.

00:03:07.550 --> 00:03:10.480
Gagin's room is yours now.

00:03:11.390 --> 00:03:13.150
This sure is Gagin's room.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:18.820
Every thing here reminds me of him
and it brings a tear to my eye.

00:03:19.730 --> 00:03:22.390
So why don't you make the room
more fitting for yourself?

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:29.230
I just thought you looked
uncomfortable here.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:33.600
I would like to keep it this way
until I'm able to avenge him.

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:35.670
That's admirable of you.

00:03:36.180 --> 00:03:39.040
My head would roll if
I did not say that.

00:03:41.580 --> 00:03:42.740
So you knew.

00:03:43.620 --> 00:03:45.420
Were you testing me?

00:03:47.890 --> 00:03:51.550
But it is the truth.
I want it to stay this way.

00:03:55.600 --> 00:03:58.760
Be careful. Byaku is ruthless.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:11.040
Hekian, what do you want?

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:15.780
You know that the master
of Karasumori switched once, right?

00:04:16.180 --> 00:04:16.840
Yes.

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:20.610
I have discovered the whereabouts
of the master.

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:21.810
Oh?

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:25.050
I would like to try and bring it
out of its hiding place.

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:28.530
That is why I want to borrow
some Ayakashi from the Task Force.

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:31.830
Very well. Choose the ones you want.

00:04:32.930 --> 00:04:34.330
Thank you very much.

00:04:42.480 --> 00:04:44.670
It looks like an ordinary marsh.

00:04:45.280 --> 00:04:48.940
Are you sure the master
of Karasumori is here?

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:51.740
The previous one, to be exact.

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:07.600
It is probably under here.

00:05:08.740 --> 00:05:13.730
I thought your Thousand Eyes
could see everything.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:15.900
We are dealing with a deity.

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:19.110
There are things even
my Thousand Eyes cannot see.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:25.280
A fearful darkness even
I cannot see through.

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:27.880
And it is right under here.

00:05:32.360 --> 00:05:36.520
Sakon-kun, please do
something about this water.

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:39.560
Bring in the Field Guardian.

00:05:55.650 --> 00:05:57.680
Field Guardian!
Drink all of the water!

00:06:01.890 --> 00:06:04.820
It's thirsty.
I'm sure it will drink it all.

00:06:09.560 --> 00:06:14.470
When we see the bottom.
I will use the Dark Whirlwind.

00:06:18.410 --> 00:06:22.910
But can the deep darkness at the bottom...

00:06:22.910 --> 00:06:26.040
be opened by brute force?

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:34.750
All right. Yukimura-kun,
read the next part.

00:06:36.090 --> 00:06:37.080
Yukimura-kun?

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:39.520
Yes...

00:06:40.430 --> 00:06:42.760
I'm sorry. I wasn't listening.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:43.420
What?

00:06:44.430 --> 00:06:49.430
Oh. No... Yukimura-kun has
lost interest in my class...

00:06:50.970 --> 00:06:53.460
I'm a failure as a teacher...

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:56.610
Are you all right?

00:06:57.150 --> 00:06:59.140
You've been acting strange lately.

00:07:00.550 --> 00:07:02.280
I was just spacing out.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:08.520
Even after Gen-kun's passing,
our lives at school continue...

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:12.830
I know we're fighting to
protect this kind of peace...

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:17.390
...but this is heartbreaking.

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:18.320
Huh?

00:07:19.870 --> 00:07:22.170
Did something happen?
Is something on your mind?

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:25.700
It's nothing.
I just haven't slept very well.

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:28.110
Oh, okay.

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:37.550
He's awake today, too.
I wonder if something happened.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:41.220
You've been acting strange.

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:46.120
Um... you're breaking your record
for being awake during class.

00:07:46.530 --> 00:07:47.520
Shut up!

00:07:50.630 --> 00:07:53.190
He seems irritated.
So change the subject.

00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:55.670
Then are you interested
in a weird incident

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.190
that happened in the neighborhood?

00:07:57.910 --> 00:07:59.340
There's been a strange incident

00:07:59.340 --> 00:08:01.310
that's caused the water in the marsh
to dry up overnight.

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:04.310
I am on the scene at
the Colorless Marsh.

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:07.980
Normally, this is a place of
relaxation for many people.

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:11.410
What on earth caused it
to end up like this?

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:13.880
What?!

00:08:14.990 --> 00:08:16.220
The Colorless Marsh!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.340
I shouldn't have come in a skirt.

00:08:52.430 --> 00:08:56.090
What is this? Uro-sama lives
in that hole?

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:57.530
This isn't it.

00:09:00.030 --> 00:09:02.470
Hey! Uro-sama!

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:07.570
Uro-sama! Answer me!

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:12.600
What should we do?
Maybe Uro-sama is already-

00:09:13.210 --> 00:09:14.810
You still alive?!

00:09:15.350 --> 00:09:16.370
Hey!

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:20.680
Yoshimori!

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:24.480
Freaking out just because
your behind was touched...

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:26.790
Train yourself more! Am I right?

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:28.950
I... I guess...

00:09:30.900 --> 00:09:35.490
Uro-sama's sleep cannot be disturbed
by Ayakashi of their level!

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:38.740
Then Uro-sama is safe. Mamezo?

00:09:39.070 --> 00:09:40.060
Yes.

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.980
Just digging a hole like this
won't lead to the Divine Field.

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:45.910
Is it the Kokuboro?

00:09:46.250 --> 00:09:48.220
Kokuboro? What is that?

00:09:48.920 --> 00:09:51.250
An Ayakashi organization trying
to take over Karasumori.

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:57.250
Oh? Uro-sama and I have been
asleep for some time.

00:09:57.590 --> 00:09:59.120
We don't know what is
going on in the outside world.

00:09:59.290 --> 00:10:00.820
Oh, really...

00:10:01.530 --> 00:10:03.520
But I suppose this is no time for that.

00:10:04.270 --> 00:10:06.700
The land will weaken if left like this.

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:10.300
So what are you going to do?
The water has dried up.

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:13.130
I will return the water within a night.

00:10:15.680 --> 00:10:18.340
You're so tiny, but you can do that?

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:20.940
I am Uro-sama's right-hand man.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:24.650
You should show your worth by
protecting that tiny spot of land, too.

00:10:26.690 --> 00:10:27.680
Wait a minute.

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:30.380
You said earlier the Kokubo something?

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:31.680
Kokuboro.

00:10:33.030 --> 00:10:36.520
Could it be the Monster Fox of
the Black Pampas Grass?

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:37.890
Monster Fox?

00:10:39.430 --> 00:10:42.060
I see. So Uro-sama is safe.

00:10:42.840 --> 00:10:45.600
So was it the Kokuboro?

00:10:46.170 --> 00:10:47.160
Probably.

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:51.280
Not only are they after Karasumori,

00:10:51.280 --> 00:10:53.510
but they are trying to disturb
Uro-sama's sleep, too.

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:57.050
Mamezo said something about
the Black Pampas Grass.

00:10:57.050 --> 00:10:58.040
Do you know anything about it?

00:10:59.120 --> 00:11:01.420
You fool!

00:11:01.660 --> 00:11:03.210
What was that for?!

00:11:04.230 --> 00:11:05.210
Look carefully!

00:11:09.400 --> 00:11:11.800
Look. This is how you write
Black Pampas Grass!

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.190
It's the name of a land.

00:11:13.970 --> 00:11:16.490
And it is also the name of
their Other World!

00:11:17.540 --> 00:11:20.800
Like I'd know! You never told me!

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:23.710
Add this to the bottom...

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:28.400
Read it!

00:11:29.780 --> 00:11:33.310
Black Pampas Grass and...
I can't read it.

00:11:33.590 --> 00:11:36.450
You fool! This makes it "Kokuboro!"

00:11:36.490 --> 00:11:38.890
They don't teach that character
in junior high.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:42.560
The organization at
Black Pampas Grass is the Kokuboro!

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:45.260
It's also the name of
the Ayakashi organization.

00:11:46.000 --> 00:11:50.000
Either way, if they've started
snooping around the Colorless Marsh,

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:53.700
it means they know a lot about us.

00:11:54.180 --> 00:11:55.540
What formidable foes...

00:11:56.910 --> 00:11:59.900
You couldn't find the master
of the Colorless Marsh?

00:12:00.310 --> 00:12:03.770
Correct. I had Sakon-kun cast
his Dark Whirlwind. But...

00:12:26.870 --> 00:12:30.670
So the master resides in
an Other World like this one?

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:35.750
Yes. However. Because Sakon-kun
caused so much commotion.

00:12:35.750 --> 00:12:39.080
An Ayakashi hiding nearby
came to see what was going on.

00:12:40.020 --> 00:12:41.890
It was just an old raccoon dog...

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.950
we captured and interrogated it.

00:12:44.830 --> 00:12:46.230
According to it,

00:12:46.230 --> 00:12:51.190
the entire area belongs to
the guardian deity-master of that marsh.

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:55.740
Only the very small speck
of land in the center.

00:12:55.740 --> 00:12:59.140
Where the school is built.
Is ruled by another.

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:00.460
Another?

00:13:00.570 --> 00:13:04.910
Yes. However. We do not know
what the relationship is

00:13:04.910 --> 00:13:10.580
between the deity of the marsh
and the master of Karasumori.

00:13:12.450 --> 00:13:15.320
What is under Karasumori?

00:13:15.920 --> 00:13:17.150
I'll look into it.

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:19.860
Will you be using Sakon again?

00:13:20.430 --> 00:13:24.860
No, that won't be necessary.
This is only an investigation.

00:13:36.710 --> 00:13:37.700
Ketsu!

00:13:41.850 --> 00:13:44.220
If only Gen-kun were here...

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.250
Ketsu!

00:13:53.360 --> 00:13:54.490
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:57.250
Ketsu!

00:14:00.630 --> 00:14:03.130
Hey, are you with the Kokuboro?!

00:14:05.340 --> 00:14:07.310
Looks like it's not.

00:14:07.310 --> 00:14:08.830
Just an ordinary Ayakashi.

00:14:09.810 --> 00:14:10.470
Metsu!

00:14:11.310 --> 00:14:12.370
Tenketsu!

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:16.410
Just more weaklings.

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:19.080
Oh, my! What is this?!

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:20.350
It appeared out of nowhere!

00:14:20.620 --> 00:14:21.280
What?!

00:14:21.520 --> 00:14:22.820
There's another one!

00:14:22.890 --> 00:14:24.450
It's good at cloaking its presence.

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:36.020
Is that the one?

00:14:55.460 --> 00:14:59.890
It takes you quite a long time to
deal with an Ayakashi of that level.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:01.030
What?

00:15:01.030 --> 00:15:03.690
I get it! That was just a decoy!

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:04.520
Ketsu!

00:15:06.430 --> 00:15:09.560
Interesting.
So this is the Kekkai Technique?

00:15:10.170 --> 00:15:11.470
He uses illusions!

00:15:13.540 --> 00:15:14.700
I can't move!

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:17.200
What is this?

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:22.010
It's Binding Shadow.
I cast it while you made your Kekkai.

00:15:22.720 --> 00:15:23.840
Why you-!

00:15:25.950 --> 00:15:28.150
Don't underestimate Demon Dogs!

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:30.150
This is nothing!

00:15:32.560 --> 00:15:35.890
Don't worry.
I'm only restraining you.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:38.150
This isn't an attack.

00:15:39.230 --> 00:15:42.170
I didn't find anything
at the Colorless Marsh.

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.100
So I wanted to check something.

00:15:44.870 --> 00:15:46.600
Check something? Check what?!

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:50.640
I don't know. That's why I'm checking.

00:16:21.380 --> 00:16:22.600
What is this?!

00:16:23.510 --> 00:16:25.670
This is different from the darkness
at the Colorless Marsh.

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:28.080
It's very different.

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:33.850
Yes... it is a darkness
created by humans.

00:16:39.860 --> 00:16:42.390
May I ask you something?

00:16:45.430 --> 00:16:49.700
Your Kekkai Technique
can manipulate space, right?

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:52.200
What are you talking about?!

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.360
You're with the Kokuboro?!

00:16:55.310 --> 00:16:56.670
So what if I am?

00:16:57.140 --> 00:16:59.510
Why, you-! Get Kaguro out here!

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:02.500
Ketsu!

00:17:07.990 --> 00:17:12.250
This is interesting.
They can freely change the size, too.

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:17.790
Just seeing that technique makes
this investigation worthwhile...

00:17:18.730 --> 00:17:19.720
Investigation?

00:17:20.200 --> 00:17:20.860
Yes.

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:24.630
In order to make Karasumori ours...

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:26.030
Why, you-

00:17:26.910 --> 00:17:27.570
Ketsu!

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:30.330
Damn!

00:17:31.350 --> 00:17:33.440
The Binding Shadow was dispelled
when the clouds hid the moon!

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:35.550
So that's the kind of technique it was...

00:17:38.120 --> 00:17:39.950
Maybe it's hiding again.

00:17:40.390 --> 00:17:42.790
No, he's really gone.

00:17:43.020 --> 00:17:44.180
I can't sense him.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:49.060
Make Karasumori theirs?!

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:50.720
That jerk!

00:17:51.400 --> 00:17:53.260
Messing around like that!

00:17:56.470 --> 00:17:58.130
How are you?

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:03.240
Much better now.
Aside from my boredom.

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:08.840
I may have a way to
ward off your boredom.

00:18:09.150 --> 00:18:11.670
What is it?
An interesting story?

00:18:12.420 --> 00:18:14.650
Hekian has returned.

00:18:15.290 --> 00:18:19.190
Oh, that eyeball boy.
Where was he?

00:18:19.430 --> 00:18:20.550
At Karasumori.

00:18:21.660 --> 00:18:24.650
He's discovered many interesting things.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.090
Oh?

00:18:26.630 --> 00:18:29.500
There is an Other World
beneath Karasumori.

00:18:29.800 --> 00:18:32.770
An Other World? Like this place?

00:18:33.370 --> 00:18:35.860
Yes. Not only that...

00:18:36.510 --> 00:18:40.470
There are still many mysteries
about Karasumori.

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:46.150
We do not know why it makes
Ayakashi stronger,

00:18:46.150 --> 00:18:48.380
nor why it is protected by humans.

00:18:49.290 --> 00:18:55.250
The key to solving the mystery
of Karasumori lies with the Kekkaishi.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.590
I don't like listening to
complicated things.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:07.140
Karasumori has been protected
by a clan of Kekkaishi over the generations.

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:17.640
A symbol they call the Hoin Mark appears
among them to signify their legitimacy.

00:19:18.020 --> 00:19:22.550
You can say they're the specialists
in protecting Karasumori.

00:19:22.990 --> 00:19:25.420
This is delicious. Do you want some?

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:33.360
In other words.
The Legitimate Heirs and Karasumori

00:19:33.400 --> 00:19:37.270
have some sort of relationship.

00:19:37.270 --> 00:19:38.830
That is what we are guessing.

00:19:39.540 --> 00:19:40.770
That's odd.

00:19:40.940 --> 00:19:45.980
How can humans have a relationship
with that strange Karasumori?

00:19:45.980 --> 00:19:47.610
They're not even
the masters of the land.

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:51.980
There is one theory to explain that.

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:58.060
Karasumori was created
by a Kekkaishi.

00:19:59.460 --> 00:20:01.720
Karasumori was created by a human?

00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:03.790
Is that even possible?

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:08.030
Princess, how did you
create this Other World?

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:10.540
I already told you.

00:20:10.770 --> 00:20:13.710
I just lived here for a long time
and it built itself.

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:17.210
That is because you are very powerful.

00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:22.140
Kekkaishi are extraordinary
Specially Talented humans.

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:23.920
According to Hekian,

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:29.820
powerful ancient Kekkaishi were
able to manipulate space.

00:20:30.460 --> 00:20:34.450
Oh? So the Kekkaishi
made Karasumori?

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:37.090
It would be natural to think that.

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.900
Don't you think we can use this?

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.160
Oh no!

00:20:46.970 --> 00:20:48.670
That one had a seed!

00:20:49.440 --> 00:20:52.310
I will have the attendant
responsible removed.

00:20:53.180 --> 00:20:55.650
Maybe to the abyss,
where it will never return.

00:20:56.780 --> 00:20:59.410
Those Kekkaishi sound interesting.

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:03.690
Yes. I believe they would be able
to ward off your boredom for a while.

00:21:04.320 --> 00:21:05.520
I certainly hope so.

00:21:10.630 --> 00:21:11.620
Sakon.

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:13.830
Yes, Byaku-sama?

00:21:14.270 --> 00:21:18.600
We will settle things once and for all
at Karasumori next time.

00:21:19.210 --> 00:21:21.680
Make sure that all preparations
are made.

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:25.240
Yes, sir! I will avenge Gagin-sama!

00:21:25.880 --> 00:21:27.280
I'm depending on you.

00:21:32.050 --> 00:21:35.080
All right! I win.
I get three pencil leads!

00:21:35.490 --> 00:21:39.820
I thought he was going to
break his record for being awake.

00:21:41.260 --> 00:21:43.130
He's back to normal.

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:46.860
I don't know what happened,
but I'm glad.

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:49.690
Now. Yukimura-kun...

00:21:50.500 --> 00:21:51.160
Yes.

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:54.710
And thus.
Even the bravest of warriors...

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:56.840
are powerless when
their destinies fail them.

00:21:56.840 --> 00:22:00.440
Pitiful warriors.
By the orders of Kamakura...

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:08.150
You were napping again.

00:22:08.490 --> 00:22:10.850
Yeah. I need my naps.

00:22:11.660 --> 00:22:13.720
You never know when they'll attack.

00:22:15.130 --> 00:22:18.790
The Kokuboro haven't given up.

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:21.440
I know we were caught off guard,

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:25.670
but that eyeball Ayakashi
made a fool out of us.

00:22:26.170 --> 00:22:28.870
We better pull ourselves together,
or Gen-kun will laugh at us!

00:22:49.160 --> 00:22:52.860
I will take the road
I believe in anywhere

00:22:53.500 --> 00:22:57.270
Wanting to protect what's
in front of my eyes

00:22:57.970 --> 00:23:01.570
The world I have yet
to know is endless

00:23:02.380 --> 00:23:06.010
I know it will make
my heart dance

00:23:07.810 --> 00:23:18.490
I feel like I could fly
for the one I love

00:23:18.530 --> 00:23:27.230
Even if I search the whole world
No one could replace you

00:23:27.930 --> 00:23:32.060
Not everyone has a tomorrow

00:23:32.110 --> 00:23:40.670
Don't cry

00:23:40.710 --> 00:23:49.420
Even if I search the whole world
No one could replace you

00:23:50.090 --> 00:23:54.250
We weren't born
to hurt each other

00:23:54.290 --> 00:24:02.670
Don't cry
